:{"concepts":["Code Review","Database Schema Mismatch","Asyncio Deprecation","Service Discovery/Port Mismatch","API Dispatch Logic"],"confidence":1,"facts":["nexi/nexi/proactivity/engine.py: pattern_store.get_failing_patterns() is non-existent; should use fetch_low_success().","nexi/nexi/proactivity/engine.py: Queries to non-existent consolidation_jobs and extractor_runs tables cause operational errors.","nexi/nexi/proactivity/engine.py: Port mismatch in health check (8080 vs 8000) between engine and vllm-gemma4.yaml.","nexi/nexi/main.py: Execution dispatch logic fails due to non-functional port replacement logic.","xnch/xnch/main.py: APScheduler job scheduling using lambda/get_event_loop() is prone to RuntimeError in Python 3.12+.","Total files reviewed: 51 source + 7 deploy; 23 files with issues (7 Critical, 11 High)."],"files":["/Users/xnch/xnchSystems/review_report.md","nexi/nexi/proactivity/engine.py","nexi/nexi/main.py","xnch/xnch/main.py"],"id":"obs_mqv8qinu_68e25a5e1f0d","importance":9,"narrative":"The review report identifies several critical runtime errors across the Nexi and XNCH services, primarily involving missing database tables, incorrect API endpoints, and deprecated asyncio patterns that will cause silent failures or crashes in modern Python environments.","sessionId":"ses_0fae6128fffeZVZEUxWHD6wrvY","subtitle":"Detailed audit report of critical bugs and architectural mismatches","timestamp":"2026-06-26T18:04:36.472Z","title":"Review of Codebase Issues (Nexi v0)","type":"file_read"},"type":"compressed"},"obs_mqv8qrjb_d07b7d09295f":{"observation":{"concepts":["service discovery","configuration management","health checks"],"confidence":0.9,"facts":["Added vllm_health_url: str = \"http://vllm-gemma4:8000/health\" to config","This endpoint is intended for use by the proactivity engine"],"files":["/Users/xnch/xnchSystems/nexi/nexi/config.py"],"id":"obs_mqv8qrjb_d07b7d09295f","importance":5,"narrative":"Modified the configuration file to include a new he